  "repair": "The first two group workers stopped on a cluster-only atmosphere filename after verifying the fluid and particle files. The two group-only repair workers reread source and destination hashes, copied the atmosphere file specified in the group runtime and verified the complete endpoint.",
  "total_bytes": 448867123190,
  "total_files": 64,
  "verification": "Each worker compared the source SHA-256 with an independent read of its copy, checked the field types, grid shape, catalogue indices, integrator step and particle time, and matched the original executable. The collector checked every installed member against its receipt, validated the double and float catalogues and scanned all final particle records with the production restart validator."
